<p><sup>Note that the ListBox is displayed as drop-down list here, because it is used in an option page of a Visual Studio extension. Visual Studio uses it as a drop-down list.</sup></p>
<p>This code could be improved by using <code>DrawMode</code> = <code>OwnerDrawVariable</code> and adapting the item height according to the measured height of the font example.</p>
